ich is challenging in itself certainly  but on harder difficulty modes there'll  be more effects on the bullet the  ballistics involved that you have to  take account of things like wind which  will be blowing the bullet left and  right there'll be fewer of the online  on-screen visual indicators to show you  what the AI are thinking and doing the  AI will react much faster as well in the  heart of difficulty modes and we've also  got customization customization  available to the difficulty modes as  well so the players can really like pick  what aspects they want whether they want  really hard AI but with a full set of  visual feedback about what's going on or  easy AI but no visual feedback it's all  open to the player about how they  approach things so this is this is Tim  Jones I've been showing you a bit of  Sniper Elite 3 the game is coming out on  the 1st of July in the US and 27th of  June in Europe on PlayStation 4 Xbox one  Xbox 360 Playstation 3 and PC  you  [Music]
 

